ame is less 8-bit and more  artsy and is surprisingly serious in  fact the true meaning of the game's  story is still debated the two games are  nearly identical in their rewind or ctrl  Z mechanic if you screw up you can  quickly undo with the click of a button  and try again without restarting from a  checkpoint this isn't just for killing  enemies it's mandatory for solving crazy  difficult puzzles this is a game for  thinkers and perfectionist some puzzles  make you go through a motion rewind time  create a clone or shadow of Tim then go  through a new motion to solve the puzzle  with you and yourself yes just like  super time force but sadly instead of  rescuing the clone and collecting its  essence you heartlessly sacrifice shadow  Tim for your own agenda jerk alright  maybe you like manipulating time in your  video game but you aren't keen on the  cutesy graphics maybe you need more  exploring in beautiful environments  let's go 3d with Prince  persia sands a time if Aladdin and  spider-man saw had a baby it would be  the young cocky prince of persia he's  tricked into releasing the sands of time  and must right his wrong with the help  of beautiful Farah thankfully the prince  is so acrobatic they're running along  walls and bouncing off the heads of  enemies is a piece of cake it's made  especially easier when you have yes a  redo button the dagger of time lets you  rewind and try again if you fall off a  ledge or get killed by an enemy this is  awesome for a 3d game since we all know  that reloading a level from the  beginning or even just from a checkpoint  can take forever while the previously  suggested games revolve around the time  manipulating mechanic here is simply  implemented into a game that almost  doesn't need it yet it's incredibly  helpful when you do use it the dagger  also lets you freeze enemies and slow  down time but it's not a crutch the  combat is still fluent the acrobatics  are intuitive and the characters are  heroic on their own but forget Farah the  prince of persia needs to get together  lark rock and spawn a super protagonist  who could also be on our olympic  gymnastics team you did blinks the time  sweeper is another game you could check  out but only if you like time-traveling  cats which you should leave a comment  with your thoughts tweet me at lisa  foiles and i'll see you next time for  another analog
 

